{
  "item": "Elpis",
  "mu_name": "Elpis",
  "mu_name_from": "NPC/Elpis.bmd, loaded as MODEL_SMELTING_NPC (ZzzOpenData.cpp:2040-2042), MuMain's MONSTER_ELPHIS, type 368 (_enum.h:4696; ZzzCharacter.cpp:14597-14603), the Refinery Tower's keeper. OpenMU S6 KanturuEvent.cs:51 stands her at 77,177.",
  "world": "kanturu",
  "object_type": -1,
  "why_this_one": "Kanturu's NPCs (the user, 2026-10-23: 'lets add kunturu npcs, if we dont have them cook them', then 'Both' -- MU's two in their maps and camp folk in the Ruins). MU's Elpis refines Gemstones into Jewels of Harmony; that system is not built, so she stands and is talked to.",
  "profile": "npc",
  "scale": 1.3,
  "scale_from": "MU stands her at c->Object.Scale = 2.5f, one tile off her spot, (x + 1, y - 1) (ZzzCharacter.cpp:14599-14600), as the Tower of Refinement's giant. Ours 1.3, about one and a half times a hero, since she stands in the Ruins camp among Baz and Amy (the user, 2026-10-25: \"scale down her size\").",
  "sheets": {
    "kannpc01": "npc_kannpc01.png",
