  "sheet_from": "Out of MuMain's Data/NPC, decoded under an npc_ prefix, lower case: kannpc01.OZJ her face, auburn hair and dark teal robe; kannpc02.OZT teal plate traced in pink runes (5% cut); kannpc03.OZT her violet veil (15% cut); kannpc04_R.OZJ a teal rune strip on black.",
